Runtime: INDEX Integrity Checker

Purpose:
  Automated verification that all files referenced in INDEX.sdd
  actually exist and that navigation links resolve. Prevents the
  "directory explosion" anti-pattern where files drift out of
  INDEX without detection.

Source:
  Derived from superpowers' zero-dep discipline + claude-mem's
  health check pattern (version-check.js sub-100ms marker).

CheckTypes:
  FileExistence:
    definition: Verify every @reference in INDEX.sdd resolves to a file
    rule: missing references emit OBS18 (index_integrity_missing)
    rule: stale references (pointing to deleted files) emit OBS19

  NavigationLink:
    definition: Verify every Navigation entry has a target file
    rule: broken navigation links emit OBS18
    rule: circular references emit OBS19 (index_integrity_circular)

  ReadOrderSequence:
    definition: Verify ReadOrder entries are valid file paths
    rule: invalid ReadOrder sequence emits OBS18

  DuplicateEntries:
    definition: Detect duplicate file references in INDEX.sdd
    rule: duplicates emit OBS17 (index_integrity_duplicate)

  StaleFiles:
    definition: Files in .sdd/ not referenced by any INDEX
    rule: unreferenced files emit OBS19 (index_integrity_stale)
    exception: files generated per-prompt (templates/*) exempt

Execution:
  trigger: pre-commit hook (optional) or CI (mandatory)
  mode: fast (existence only) or full (also checks content hash)
  frequency: on every .sdd/ file change
  timeout: 5 seconds (fail-fast)

  flow:
    parse INDEX.sdd @references ->
      resolve each to .sdd/<path>.sdd ->
      check existence (fast) or content hash (full) ->
      emit OBS18/OBS19 for violations ->
      report summary to stdout

Output:
  summary: total_checked, missing, stale, circular, duplicates
  violations: list of { path, type, severity, suggested_fix }
  exit_code: 0 (pass) / 1 (violations found) / 2 (critical structural error)

Rules:
  [IDX1] INDEX integrity check MUST run in pre-commit hook.
  [IDX2] CI MUST block merge if INDEX integrity check fails.
  [IDX3] Missing references MUST be fixed before commit.
  [IDX4] Stale files MUST be either referenced or deleted.
  [IDX5] Circular references MUST be broken.
  [IDX6] Duplicate entries MUST be deduplicated.
  [IDX7] AI MUST NOT silently skip integrity violations.

Navigation:
  Runtime: @INDEX.sdd
  Events: @events.sdd
   Observability: @../observability/INDEX.sdd

State: +
  Note:
  Generated file — runs as claude-code hook or CI job.
  Not read by AI during normal operation; invoked by
  /sdd-analyze command or pre-commit hook.